Package: headplane
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 24.2), nodejs (<< 25), ca-certificates, adduser
Description: Web interface for managing Headscale
 Headplane manages a Headscale Tailnet through a web interface and includes
 the optional Headplane Agent and browser SSH assets.
 Configure /etc/headplane/config.yaml before enabling headplane.service.
